OL,3,GNEWSABeach attacker sentenced to 10    
OL,4,Ayears after victim, 17, loses leg in   
OL,5,Abank holiday stabbing                  
OL,7,FA man whose unprovoked knife attack on 
OL,8,Fa 17-year-old boy caused the victim to 
OL,9,Flose his leg has been sentenced to     
OL,10,F10-and-a-half years.                   
OL,12,FIdris Ahmed, 19, from Riverside in     
OL,13,FCardiff, attacked the teenager on Barry
OL,14,FIsland beach on bank holiday Monday, on
OL,15,F25 May. He previously denied grievous  
OL,16,Fbodily harm with intent, and possessing
OL,17,Fa knife, but changed his plea to guilty
OL,18,Fduring the trial.                      
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
