OL,3,GNEWSABeach attacker sentenced to 10    
OL,4,Ayears after victim, 17, loses leg in   
OL,5,Abank holiday stabbing                  
OL,7,FThe victim, who cannot be named because
OL,8,Fof a court order relating to his age,  
OL,9,Fhad to have his leg amputated below the
OL,10,Fknee after the wound became infected.  
OL,12,FIn a statement read at Newport Crown   
OL,13,FCourt, the victim's mother said she    
OL,14,Fcontinued to have nightmares, and often
OL,15,Fran into her son's room to check on    
OL,16,Fhim.                                   
